cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "若使用本仓库的证书/证明内容，请引用此条目。"
title: "Admissible k-tuple minimal diameters H(k): Lean-certified lower bounds"
abstract: >-
  Proof-carrying computation for the minimal diameter H(k) of admissible
  k-tuples. For k in {43,44,45,46,50} all even diameters below H(k)
  (319 targets in total) are certified in Lean 4: certificate trees for
  residue-class assignment failures, a verified certificate checker
  (CertVerify.lean), and a hand-written soundness proof (Sound.lean)
  showing "certificate valid => no admissible k-tuple of diameter <= d".
  SAT witnesses and triple independent verification are included.
  The M-functional side is analyzed but the question whether the true
  M_{k,eps} < 4 for all k < 50 remains open.
authors:
  - family-names: "Guo"
    given-names: "Shaoyang"
    orcid: ""
date-released: "2026-08-20"
keywords:
